<title>USA: CyberOptics to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>CyberOptics to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CyberOptics Corp said Monday its board of directors has approved the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of stock.</p>
<p>The sensors and systems company said it has about 5.2 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will be used for employee compensation plans and other corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
